{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"c71c20f4d63a28829bad75e93ad858a322dc4ffcbe1d504342fa88f19253826f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["更美之約的大祭司"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我們所講的要點是：我們有這樣一位大祭司，祂現在已經坐在天上至高上帝的寶座右邊，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["並在聖所裡供職。這聖所就是真正的聖幕，不是人建立的，而是主親手建立的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["所有的大祭司都是為了向上帝獻禮物和祭物而設立的，因此我們這位大祭司也必須有所獻上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["祂如果是在地上，根本不會做祭司，因為地上已經有照律法向上帝獻禮物的祭司了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["這些祭司的事奉都是仿效和反映天上的事，正如摩西建聖幕的時候，上帝警告他說：",{"text":"「你務要照著在山上指示你的樣式造各樣器具。」","poem":1},{"noteId":23}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但如今，耶穌得到了一個更超越的職任，正如祂擔任了更美之約的中保，這約是根據更美的應許所立的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因為如果第一個約沒有缺點，就不必另立新約了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["然而，上帝指責祂的子民，說：",{"text":"「主說，看啊，時候將到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要與以色列家和猶大家另立新約，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這約不同於我與他們祖先所立的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是我牽著他們祖先的手領他們離開埃及時所立的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們不持守我的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我不再理會他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主又說，那些日子以後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我將與以色列家立這樣的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把我的律法放在他們腦中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寫在他們心上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作他們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要作我的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰都無需再教導自己的鄰居和弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說，『你要認識主。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們無論尊卑都必認識我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要赦免他們的過犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘掉他們的罪惡。」","poem":1},{"noteId":24}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["上帝既然說要立新約，就是把第一個約當作舊的了，那漸漸陳舊過時的很快就會消失。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":23,"caller":"+","text":"出埃及記25·40。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":5}},{"noteId":24,"caller":"+","text":"耶利米書31·31‑34。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}